## 1. Database Schema (Clean & Final)

### `members`

```sql
CREATE TABLE members (
  id          UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  name        TEXT NOT NULL,
  email       TEXT UNIQUE,
  avatar_url  TEXT,
  color       TEXT NOT NULL,   -- predefined per member, see seed data
  is_active   BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT true,
  deleted_at  TIMESTAMPTZ,     -- soft delete ✅
  created_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),
  updated_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()
);
```

### `categories`

```sql
CREATE TABLE categories (
  id          UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  name        TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,
  icon_name   TEXT NOT NULL,   -- lucide icon slug: 'shopping-cart', 'wifi', 'home'
  color       TEXT NOT NULL,   -- distinct hex per category
  sort_order  INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  created_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()
);
```

**No soft delete. No `is_default` flag.** Categories are **read-only seed data** — the app does not expose a `POST /categories` endpoint. Users pick from the fixed list; admins add new ones directly in Supabase if needed.

